Example data (inst/extdata/)
  - lobster/: a subset of the SNP genotypes of European lobsters of Jenkins
    et al. (2019) Evolutionary Applications 12: 1881-1899,
    doi:10.1111/eva.12849; data from Dryad, doi:10.5061/dryad.2v1kr38,
    released under CC0.
  - anolis/: the RAD-seq genotypes of Anolis punctatus of Prates et al.
    (2018) Ecology and Evolution 8: 11932-11944, doi:10.1002/ece3.4650,
    from https://github.com/ivanprates/2018_Anolis_EcolEvol
    (data/VCFtools_SNMF_punctatus_t70_s10_n46/).
  - ploidy/arenosa_ploidy_example.vcf.gz: 200 loci of Arabidopsis arenosa
    from Wos et al. (2019) Annals of Botany 124: 255-268,
    doi:10.1093/aob/mcz070, taken from the data of the tutorial on
    polyploid population genomics by Magdalena Bohutinska and Filip Kolar
    (https://github.com/mbohutinska/PolyplChapter), which accompanies
    Bohutinska et al. (2023) Population genomic analysis of
    diploid-autopolyploid species. Methods in Molecular Biology 2545:
    297-324, doi:10.1007/978-1-0716-2561-3_16.
  - data/distruct_colours.rda: the colour palette of distruct (Rosenberg
    2004, Molecular Ecology Notes 4: 137-138).
